## Global Constraints

- Python 3.11+, 4 GB RAM, 2 GB free disk — no VM/Docker/cloud/internet after setup
- No hardcoded credentials/SIDs/flags/path IDs — all must resolve dynamically
- First submission is final — zero revision policy
- Every claim must have raw artifact + exact locator in `evidence-index.csv`
- BloodHound/graph-only output is not proof — must validate against raw records
- Automation must succeed 3/3 from clean state
- 16 deliverables in one view-only Google Drive folder named `UBI-ID-STAGE_8`
- All source artifacts must be read-only after initial capture
- Git commits must not be backdated
- AI assistance must be declared in integrity attestation
- Graph output must include `schema_version` field

